Feature: Exit payment is refused when it cannot be completed # features/exit_payment_negative.feature:1
  As a registered ParkEase driver
  I want my parking fee to be charged automatically from my wallet when I exit
  So that I can leave the plaza without queuing at a payment booth
  @negative
  Scenario: Wallet is Rs. 1 short of the total payable           # features/exit_payment_negative.feature:7
    Given the driver "Ali" is logged in                          # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:37
    And the driver has a linked petrol car with plate "LEA-1234" # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:47
    And the wallet balance is Rs. 239                            # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:54
    And the vehicle entered the plaza 2 hours and 10 minutes ago # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:59
    When the driver exits the plaza                              # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:74
    Then the screen shows "Insufficient wallet balance"          # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:82
    And the total paid is Rs. 0                                  # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:103
    And the wallet balance is now Rs. 239                        # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:108
    And the gate stays closed                                    # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:118

  @negative
  Scenario: Driver who is not logged in cannot pay by wallet     # features/exit_payment_negative.feature:19
    Given the driver "Ali" is not logged in                      # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:42
    And the driver has a linked petrol car with plate "LEA-1234" # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:47
    And the wallet balance is Rs. 1,000                          # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:54
    And the vehicle entered the plaza 2 hours and 10 minutes ago # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:59
    When the driver exits the plaza                              # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:74
    Then the screen shows "Please log in to pay by wallet"       # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:82
    And the wallet balance is now Rs. 1,000                      # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:108
    And the gate stays closed                                    # features/steps/parkease_steps.py:118

